01:33:59,472 --> 01:34:02,241
I don't think he's the spy. Or is he?

2034
01:34:06,313 --> 01:34:08,914
The favorability vote is brutal.

2035
01:34:09,049 --> 01:34:11,550
there had probably already been
four favorability votes.

2036
01:34:11,551 --> 01:34:15,087
If you get three votes from 12 people,
that's 36.

2037
01:34:15,088 --> 01:34:17,456
So four times 36.

2038
01:34:17,457 --> 01:34:19,158
Everyone averages around 18.

2039
01:34:20,995 --> 01:34:21,995
(Banu's cumulative favorability score: 20)

2040
01:34:21,996 --> 01:34:23,463
Mine is so low.

2041
01:34:24,865 --> 01:34:27,733
It's slightly above average,
but still nowhere near safe.

2042
01:34:27,734 --> 01:34:28,968
(Cumulative Favorability Scores,
Superman: 24, Sugar: 22, Banu: 20)

2043
01:34:28,969 --> 01:34:30,136
(Ted, Gray, Polar Bear: 19,
Dark Knight, Michael, Go Ae Shin: 18)

2044
01:34:30,137 --> 01:34:31,270
(Benjamin, Nangja: 14)

2045
01:34:31,871 --> 01:34:33,506
